From 777dae9e1df74a77d1878b173b9eddfcf89f392f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:54:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] isaac-e0t7: session tags stored as a vector match selectors

contains? on a vector is an index lookup, so [:ops] never matched a tag
selector. tags-of, open-session!, update-session!, sessions set, and the
feature session table now coerce a vector or list of keywords (or their
names) to a set. A session.edn that still holds a vector is selected
without rewriting the file.
---
